      "objective": "检验 1−cos x 与 x sin x 的等价无穷小替换。",
      "stem": "计算 lim_(x→0) (1−cos x)/(x sin x)。要求写出所用等价无穷小。",
      "answer": "1/2。",
      "final_value": "1/2",
      "solution_steps": [
